<div style="font-size:17px; font-style:italic; color:#466587; margin:0 0 16px 0; line-height:1.4;">The Anatomy of an ISO 20022 Address Fix</div>

<p style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font-size:15px; font-style:italic; line-height:1.6; color:#466587;">97% of payment traffic already runs on MX. Roughly 60% of the addresses inside are still unstructured. Here's <a href="https://www.ionova.ai/blog/iso-20022-address-solution-four-paths?utm_source=newsletter" style="color:#0972D3; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;">the whole anatomy of fixing it</a> — before 15 November 2026.</p>

