<tr><td style="padding:0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="18" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#232F3E;">&bull;</td><td valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#232F3E;">The <strong>EPC 2025 Rulebook v1.1</strong> adopts the same content rule across all five SEPA schemes — SCT, SCT Inst, SDD Core, SDD B2B and OCT Inst — at once.</td></tr></table></td></tr>
