<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#232F3E;"><strong>The corporate owns the data.</strong> Payment addresses originate and live in corporate systems: the ERP, the treasury management system, the CRM, the supplier and customer masters.</p>

